  id: ear_afterecho
  displayName: Afterecho
  description: 'For four seconds every cut you make is remembered. A heartbeat later a pale echo of the blade cuts again in the same place, at half strength - strike, roll away, and the echo keeps fighting. The Ear mantras are attuned together: they take all three sockets.'
  icon: {fileID: 0}
  iconName: ic_ear_afterecho
  accent: {r: 0.65, g: 0.82, b: 1, a: 1}
  cooldown: 18
  unlockedAtStart: 0
  setId: ear
  setSlot: 0
  setName: Mantras of the Ear
  setDescription: 'The Precentor heard the bells, the Eye, the dead. Now you hear what he heard. Afterecho, Discord and Forewarning come as one and take all three sockets: echo your blade, turn the enemy on itself, and hear the blow before it lands.'
  duration: 4
  echoDelay: 1
  echoMul: 0.5
  castLock: 0.25
  echoTint: {r: 0.65, g: 0.82, b: 1, a: 0.8}
